{"id":"3bb486e3086e586d","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-descriptive4-borel-complete-set.md","title":"ZFC Descriptive4 Borel Complete Set","display":"df-zfc-descriptive4-borel-complete-set — ZFC Descriptive4 Borel Complete Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-descriptive4-borel-complete-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-descriptive4-borel-complete-set"],"display":"df-zfc-descriptive4-borel-complete-set — ZFC Descriptive4 Borel Complete Set","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-descriptive4-borel-complete-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-descriptive4-borel-complete-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-descriptive4-borel-complete-set — ZFC Descriptive4 Borel Complete Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3169dc41990b4bbe\" href=\"?note=3169dc41990b4bbe\" title=\"58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space\">58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal B_X,A,\\Gamma\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal B_X,A,\\Gamma\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StandardBorelSpace}\">\\(\\operatorname{StandardBorelSpace}\\)</span> (standard-Borel-space predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> (the supplied pointclass slice on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4BorelCompleteSet}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4BorelCompleteSet}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对函数图 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 与集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^{-1}[B]\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f):f(x)\\in B\\}\">\\(f^{-1}[B]\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f):f(x)\\in B\\}\\)</span>；函数图及定义域使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive4\\text{-}borel\\text{-}complete\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4BorelCompleteSet}_S(X,\\mathcal B_X,A,\\Gamma)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{StandardBorelSpace}(X,\\mathcal B_X)\\land\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land A\\in\\Gamma\\land\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\;\\exists f\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,X)\\land\\forall C\\in\\mathcal B_X\\;(f^{-1}[C]\\in\\mathcal B_X)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(x\\in B\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in A)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive4\\text{-}borel\\text{-}complete\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4BorelCompleteSet}_S(X,\\mathcal B_X,A,\\Gamma)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{StandardBorelSpace}(X,\\mathcal B_X)\\land\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land A\\in\\Gamma\\land\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\;\\exists f\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,X)\\land\\forall C\\in\\mathcal B_X\\;(f^{-1}[C]\\in\\mathcal B_X)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(x\\in B\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in A)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is completeness relative to the supplied set-coded pointclass slice <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span>: every member of the slice Borel-reduces to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> on the same standard Borel space.</li>\n<li>Treating <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> as a set function on every standard Borel space would require a proper-class domain; the slice formulation keeps every application and quantifier set-sized.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space","status":"resolved","id":"3169dc41990b4bbe","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-descriptive2-standard-borel-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (set-function predicate, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"对函数图 $f$ 与集合 $B$，$f^{-1}[B]\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f):f(x)\\in B\\}$；函数图及定义域使用 [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"X,\\mathcal B_X,A,\\Gamma\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{StandardBorelSpace}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4BorelCompleteSet}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"f^{-1}[B]\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f):f(x)\\in B\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}descriptive4\\text{-}borel\\text{-}complete\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescriptive4BorelCompleteSet}_S(X,\\mathcal B_X,A,\\Gamma)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{StandardBorelSpace}(X,\\mathcal B_X)\\land\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land A\\in\\Gamma\\land\\forall B\\in\\Gamma\\;\\exists f\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,X)\\land\\forall C\\in\\mathcal B_X\\;(f^{-1}[C]\\in\\mathcal B_X)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(x\\in B\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in A)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false}],"bytes":1849,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1837","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-descriptive4-borel-complete-set.md|58-df-zfc-descriptive4-borel-complete-set]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751","3169dc41990b4bbe"]}